# rena0-single-hover — F1-3 fixture, P2-7 jump family (one hover per airtime)
#
# Source: the jump row (40) is admitted ONLY while grounded — FUN_00445ee0's jump
# branch requires the grounded byte `0x84 != 0`. No airborne branch returns to it, so
# releasing and re-pressing the jump button mid-air resumes nothing: the air chain
# (40 -> 41 -> 42) runs once per airtime, and the fighter falls or takes another air
# action. The port modelled the hover as a time budget re-enterable at will, which let
# a re-press keep floating; this fixture pins the corrected one-shot rule.
#
# Shape: jump, hold 10 ticks (climb), release, press and hold again. The re-press must not
# re-arm the climb, so the fighter falls in the arc the release started and lands well
# before the window's end; with a re-enterable hover the re-press kept it aloft.
combo 0 0
seed 5489
spawn 0 0 0 0
spawn 1 0 0 2000
collision open-field
input 0 JUMP
input 10 -
input 16 JUMP
expect 20 airborne 1
expect 55 airborne 0
expect 60 dummy_static 1
